~ start
if first == true:
	=>< Introduction
	set first = false
else:
	=>< Reintroduction
if check_feathers():
	What will you do?
	- There’s more to see in this world than the inside of a tower. (Give)
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers()
		do save_npc()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- This food won’t save you. When the waters come, you’ll be washed away. (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do doom_player()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END
else:
	What will you do?
	- ??? [if check_feathers()]
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- This food won’t save you. When the waters come, you’ll be washed away. (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END

~ Introduction
The Pragmatist: Goodness, You scared me! 
The Pragmatist: Did you come from below? You must have, you’re soaked through!
The Pragmatist: Come, sit! Have a bite to eat! This spot is dry enough, at least.
The Pragmatist: Don’t be shy, take it! And don’t worry about taking too much, I have enough food here to last me a couple of years at least!
The Pragmatist: If I had to guess, this place used to have ships coming and going in its hey day, but I’ve yet to see one in all of my time here…
The Pragmatist: So, are you headed for the top?
 => END

~ Reintroduction
The Pragmatist: Oh, you’re still here! 
The Pragmatist: Feel free to stay as long as you like! The food is still good, and there’s plenty of it!
 => END

~ Give_Dialogue
The Pragmatist: Oh, what’s this?
The Pragmatist: Hmm… Are you saying I should leave? But why? I’m safe here, surrounded by plenty…
#[tower rumbling sound plays]
The Pragmatist: …Then again, perhaps it is time to move on!
The Pragmatist: You said you were headed to the top?
The Pragmatist: Then I shall head that way as well, my friend.
The Pragmatist: I hope to see you at the top!
 => END

~ Take_Dialogue
The Pragmatist: How dare you! You think I’m a fool? 
The Pragmatist: The water won’t reach me here! It won’t!
The Pragmatist: You should leave, get out of here! Take these useless things and go!
The Pragmatist: … I’ll be safe, as long as I stay right here…
 => END